# Declared factual interface
```catala
declaration structure Person:
  data age content integer
  data rate content integer

declaration scope Household:
  input people content list of Person
  output total content integer
```

```catala
declaration scope Entitlement:
  input age content integer
  input rate content integer
  output amount content integer

scope Entitlement:
  definition amount equals
    if age > 18 then rate else 0

scope Household:
  definition total equals
    sum integer of
      (map each person among people to
        (output of Entitlement with {
          -- age: person.age
          -- rate: person.rate
        }).amount)
```
